      "body": "## Summary\n\nStreaming `InternlmDetector` dropped every tool call after the first when `<|action_start|>` arrived in its own chunk. The full marker is `<|action_start|> <|plugin|>`, and those are separate added tokens, so a token-at-a-time stream splits them.\n\nAfter the first call, a buffer that did not yet contain the full marker was cleared. The prefix is now kept until the next chunk finishes the marker. Non-streaming parsing is unchanged.\n\nFixes #46661\n\n## Test\n\n`python3 -m pytest test/registered/unit/function_call/test_internlm_streaming_detector.py -q`\n\nThe split-marker case returned only the Tokyo call before this change and returns Tokyo then Paris after it.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40762945446](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40762945446)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40762945578](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40762945578)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40762945470](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40762945470)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
